{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a 2D sliding tile-merging puzzle game inspired by 2048.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. In this game, you need to merge tiles on the board to reach each level\u2019s objective. Be careful \u2014 over-merging can lead to failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. You can clear levels with any number of moves, or carefully plan the best strategy. If you complete a level in the minimum number of moves, you will earn a star. Levels marked EX<strong>\u00a0</strong>have no move requirement\u2014you only need to clear them to earn a star.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Most levels take under 10 moves to solve, and none go over 30. Don\u2019t worry about making it too complicated\u2014sometimes it\u2019s just a small trick, other times just skipping a few extra moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. The game features a dynamic unlock system. Completed levels and earned stars will help unlock new stages. Feel free to explore and enjoy the game at your own pace.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"w1 Pass","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3639930/32a8221f199a334ff4e7237f77dc225e9461651c.jpg"},{"name":"w2 Pass","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3639930/32a8221f199a334ff4e7237f77dc225e9461651c.jpg"},{"name":"w3 Pass","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3639930/32a8221f199a334ff4e7237f77dc225e9461651c.jpg"},{"name":"w4 Pass","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3639930/32a8221f199a334ff4e7237f77dc225e9461651c.jpg"},{"name":"w1 Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3639930/32a8221f199a334ff4e7237f77dc225e9461651c.jpg"},{"name":"w2 Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3639930/32a8221f199a334ff4e7237f77dc225e9461651c.jpg"},{"name":"w3 Clear","p